Several small, purely mechanical Groovy patterns for interacting with the
Hubitat platform — specifically the internal self-hosted-HTTP-call pattern
(an App fetching a resource from its own hub via `httpGet` to a local URL)
and the defensive HTTP response body reader (`readHttpBody`) — were adapted
from:

    evdev/hubitat-modern-dashboard
    https://github.com/evdev/hubitat-modern-dashboard
