    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

See that project's LICENSE for the full license text. This NOTICE exists to
credit those specific adapted patterns, not to claim any broader
relationship between the two projects — this repo's actual purpose (wrapping
Maker API from a proxying App) is a different architecture than that
project's (direct in-process device access with no Maker API dependency).
